 402:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/themes/mono/../../core/../misc/lv_style.h **** /**
 403:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/themes/mono/../../core/../misc/lv_style.h ****  * Copy all properties of a style to an other.
